## Overview

This PR refactors all Java classes to move final field assignments from inline declarations to constructors (for instance fields) or static initializer blocks (for static fields), as requested in the issue. This improves code maintainability and follows Java best practices for field initialization.

## Changes

### Static Final Fields
All static final fields (except compile-time constants) now use static initializer blocks:

**Before:**
```java
public class Example {
    private static final Logger LOGGER = KompeterLogger.getLogger(Example.class);
    private static final Pattern PATTERN = Pattern.compile("[A-Za-z0-9_]+");
}
```

**After:**
```java
public class Example {
    private static final Logger LOGGER;
    private static final Pattern PATTERN;

    static {
        LOGGER = KompeterLogger.getLogger(Example.class);
        PATTERN = Pattern.compile("[A-Za-z0-9_]+");
    }
}
```

### Instance Final Fields
All instance final fields now initialize in constructors, with default constructors created where needed:

**Before:**
```java
public class MainFooter {
    private final JLabel breadcrumbsPathJLabel = new JLabel();
    private final AtomicBoolean initialized = new AtomicBoolean(false);
    private final MemoryBar memoryBar = new MemoryBar();
}
```

**After:**
```java
public class MainFooter {
    private final JLabel breadcrumbsPathJLabel;
    private final AtomicBoolean initialized;
    private final MemoryBar memoryBar;

    public MainFooter() {
        breadcrumbsPathJLabel = new JLabel();
        initialized = new AtomicBoolean(false);
        memoryBar = new MemoryBar();
    }
}
```

## Important Exceptions

Compile-time constants used in switch statements remain inline to satisfy Java language requirements:

```java
public static final int SQLITE = 1;  // Kept inline - used in switch/case
```

## Impact

- **56 files refactored** across all 8 modules
- **Zero breaking changes** - all builds and tests passing
- **No security vulnerabilities** - CodeQL scan completed successfully
- Improved initialization order clarity and reduced risk of forward reference errors

## Modules Updated

- kompeter-database (8 files)
- kompeter-utilities (10 files)  
- kompeter-configuration (4 files)
- kompeter-auth (1 file)
- kompeter-cryptography (1 file)
- kompeter-monitoring (3 files)
- kompeter-pointofsale (1 file)
- kompeter-app-desktop (28 files)

## Testing

✅ All unit tests pass  
✅ All Maven builds succeed  
✅ CodeQL security scan: 0 vulnerabilities found

